      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Unfortunately, we're limited to the status settings Canny provides (though there is a popular request on THEIR Canny for custom status titles).\nCommunication is always being discussed internally, and we're hoping things like the upcoming VRChat Dev stream will help address some user concerns.\nhttps://twitter.com/VRChat/status/1124094601147617280",
