  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-05-06T07:21:59.369Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The first step to being transparent is to let users know how long it will take to implement a feature.\nAdding this to the canny will give users a view into how long it takes for stuff to be made.\nThis gives a proper push to organize small \"short wait\" features in the meantime instead of being in limbo and forgotten in the current system\n",
